Package: com.wilburt.oits
Name: OITS
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Status bar layout module for OITUI. Repositions system status bar elements to avoid overlap with OITI's simulated Dynamic Island, working toward an iOS 26/27-style layout.
Maintainer: wilburt
Author: wilburt
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), com.wilburt.oitcore
